{"type":"user","uuid":"bf3c0216-c011-4b4a-81cd-0a304e31ebac","session_id":"1675caed-dfe6-4d9a-9182-2d0c7feb6e1e","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_4p5q7ndv","is_error":false,"content":"# Suite-013 S10 resource assignment\n\n- Phase: `HIL_RUNNING`; manager: `PLAN2.SUITE.MANAGER.015`; doer: Atlas.\n- Exact leases: Atlas provider/workspace/cache; STM-A board/probe `066FFF514988525067233337`/COM12;\n  STM-B board/probe `0668FF514988525067213913`/COM17; scoped logical USB enumeration; isolated\n  S10 MCP/state/artifact root `.agent-workspace/mcp-root-001`; exact MCP process lifetime.\n- Server: `5ac29577a5821dfdef6b7bf626ae5b09c32a7c8a` / tree\n  `d243b3a63b7c8e1e062672c34eaa88aa707ea91e`, launched only as\n  `C:\\Users\\Jason\\Documents\\Jason\\Orchestrator_Harness\\Firmware\\BYO-Firmware-MCP\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pyocd_debug_mcp.server`\n  with BYO checkout as cwd and `BYO_MCP_ARTIFACT_ROOT` bound to the isolated root above.\n- Authorization: package `.agent-workspace/USER_DELEGATED_AUTHORIZATION.md`, SHA-256\n  `090af94eec7b12b8fd800984ddd86710619077ab010d6de33270ccd13a8cb9f6`.\n- Scope: ordinary non-destructive setup/validation/connect/info/logical-disconnect only, each through\n  populated plan, ordinary permission when required, and confirmed exact identity. No flash,\n  physical change, unlock, mass erase, protection change, bootloader replacement, or recovery.\n- Final: both boards logically disconnected and every plan/permission/tool/process/lease terminal.\n\n## Replacement assignment 002\n\nAfter complete predecessor absence proof, the same exact board/probe/VCOM leases are reassigned to\nAtlas replacement session with fresh MCP/state/artifact root `.agent-workspace/mcp-root-002` and no\nretained plan, permission, connection, validation, tool, or server-run authority.\n"}]}}
